            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.2+MAT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22.2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naajoki ilo malaika, “Ingero, ena; emayiana lelo ooitoomonoki to sirua le nkiyama o Lkuoo le Ker.” Naajoki ninye nanu, “Irorei oosipa le Enkai kulo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabatata too nkejek enyena aserem ninye, kake aatiaaka ninye nanu, “Mintoki aiko neijia! Amu kara ake osinka oasisho te nebo iyie o lalashera linono ooibung'ita enchakenisho e Yesu. Teserema Enkai!” Amu ore enchakenisho e Yesu ninye enkiyang'et e naibon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olakedoni le mbarta naibor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
