          "text": " Naitoki adol olmalaika eitashe ti atua enkolong. Nebuaku aipotisho to ltoilo sapuk aipot imotonyi pooki naapuoto te mpolos o loing'ang'e, nejoki, “Wootu enturrurrunye osirua kitok le Enkai, ",
          "type": "text",
